// TEMPLATE — copy this file to `lib/env.dart` and fill in your own values.
//
//     cp lib/env.dart.example lib/env.dart
//
// `lib/env.dart` is gitignored because it holds live credentials (WooCommerce
// consumer key/secret, payment gateway keys, OneSignal key, Google API key).
// Never commit it.
//
// The real file is normally exported from the Fluxstore dashboard rather than
// hand-written. It is a single `environment` map with ~86 top-level keys; the
// ones below are the minimum needed to boot the app. Anything you leave out
// falls back to the defaults in `lib/common/config/default_env.dart`.
//
// Keys that must NOT be shared publicly:
//   serverConfig.consumerKey / serverConfig.consumerSecret
//   stripeConfig, paypalConfig, razorpayConfig, cashfreeConfig, payStackConfig,
//   modemPayConfig and the other *Config payment blocks
//   oneSignalKey, googleApiKey

